{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"a1-practice-21","level":"A1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Akkusativ","bn":"কর্ম কারক (Akkusativ)"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich kaufe ___ Tisch.","options":["der","den","dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"পুংলিঙ্গ কর্ম কারকে der → den","id":"a1-practice-21-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er hat ___ Schwester.","options":["eine","einen","einem"],"answer":0,"explanation":"স্ত্রীলিঙ্গে কোনো পরিবর্তন হয় না","id":"a1-practice-21-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir besuchen ___ Museum.","options":["den","das","dem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"ক্লীবলিঙ্গে পরিবর্তন হয় না","id":"a1-practice-21-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich brauche ___ Kugelschreiber.","options":["ein","einen","eine"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Kugelschreiber পুংলিঙ্গ → einen","id":"a1-practice-21-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Siehst du ___ Mann dort?","options":["der","den","die"],"answer":1,"id":"a1-practice-21-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sie trinkt ___ Saft.","options":["einen","ein","eine"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Saft পুংলিঙ্গ → einen","id":"a1-practice-21-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich liebe ___.","options":["dich","du","dir"],"answer":0,"explanation":"du → dich (কর্ম কারক)","id":"a1-practice-21-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Kennst du ___? – Ja, ich kenne ihn.","options":["er","ihn","ihm"],"answer":1,"explanation":"er → ihn","id":"a1-practice-21-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich esse ___ Apfel.","options":["einen","ein","einer"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Apfel পুংলিঙ্গ → einen","id":"a1-practice-21-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir haben ___ Katze.","options":["einen","eine","ein"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Katze স্ত্রীলিঙ্গ → eine","id":"a1-practice-21-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich kaufe ___ Computer.","options":["ein","einen","einem"],"answer":1,"explanation":"Computer পুংলিঙ্গ → einen","id":"a1-practice-21-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Er sieht ___ Film.","options":["den","der","dem"],"answer":0,"explanation":"পুংলিঙ্গ কর্ম কারকে der → den","id":"a1-practi